+    // Typing with the system's keyboard.  Panda's window turns the keys it
+    // is given into typed letters, as a computer's keyboard does, so the
+    // game's own text boxes take the typing as they would on a computer,
+    // with no copy of the text kept here.  A phone's keyboard does not send
